  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Charamba Potato Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at strengthening the market linkage relationships of Charamba and expand the coops business. The project will fund the following activities a): business training and planning; b) purchase fund; c) train staff and board members in good governance practices d):train staff in project and financial management; e)purchase inputs on a revolving loan scheme, f) exchange visits;</narrative>
  </description>
